  "keyFeatures": [
    "Single-endpoint payment API for purchase, authorize, capture, refund, and cancel",
    "Card tokenization and vault for recurring and returning-shopper payments",
    "3D Secure (3DS2) challenge handling with automatic resume flow",
    "Subscriptions with plans, trials, dunning, pause/resume, and plan changes",
    "Browser-side JS SDK with hosted fields and drop-in Checkout Widget (PCI-safe)",
    "Apple Pay and Google Pay wallet buttons via the JS SDK",
    "40+ alternative payment methods (Pix, ACH, iDEAL, Klarna, and more) through one endpoint",
    "Idempotency-Key support on all mutating endpoints to prevent duplicate charges",
    "Sandbox environment with test cards for development and testing",
    "Airline data / level-3 data support for card payments"
  ],
